<LegalPage title="Privacy policy" description="How strictbudget handles your data.">
  <p>
    The privacy policy for the hosted service will be published here before sign ups open. Until then,
    here is what this website does today.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>It sets no cookies and runs no analytics or third party trackers.</li>
    <li>Its fonts and images are served from this site, not from a third party.</li>
    <li>The share buttons on blog posts only contact LinkedIn or your email app when you click them.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Questions? Ask in <a href={links.discussions}>GitHub Discussions</a>.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
